# The sdist also carries what napari-lite's own tests (tests/) read besides
# the package: the tools and examples they run, the benchmark scripts, the
# changelog, the vendor record and the test data.  docs/ stays on GitHub.
include CHANGELOG.md SYNC.md VENDORED.json
graft tests/data
graft tools
graft examples
graft bench
global-exclude *.py[cod]
